<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank bill gross yield 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank bill gross yield 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average gross yield in a Dutch auction on Thursday offering five billion crowns in 13-week Czech National Bank liquidity bills was 13.50 percent, and the auction was slightly undersubscribed.</p>
<p>The central bank said 4.491 billion crowns were accepted at the maximum acceptable bid of 13.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
